[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_DISAPPROVE]
Prohibition of Sale

[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_DISAPPROVE_desc]
The sale of the Crystal of Tiamat is prohibited, and the crystal mine is temporarily taken over by the government of Stratusburg.\nAs for those crystal jewelry that have been processed but not yet sold, of course, they are all owned by the government.

[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_DISAPPROVE_DISABLED_TOOLTIP]
In order to obtain funds from Wind Rider, we have had to withdraw this decision.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_DISAPPROVE]
禁止销售

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_DISAPPROVE_desc]
禁止对廷马克图水晶的销售，水晶矿暂时由层云堡政府接管。\n至于那些已经加工但是还未出售的水晶首饰，当然是收归政府所有。

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_DISAPPROVE_DISABLED_TOOLTIP]
为了从乘风处获取经费，我们已经不得不撤回了这个决定。

